Operation Blood Hunt is a action, adventure, horror
film directed by Louis Mandylor.

2
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:38,000
Prolific expert of the occult and whiskey, Reverend Conte, accompanies a ragtag group of military rejects to a remote South Pacific Island to
investigate the disappearance of Marines units  stationed there in 1944, said to be at the hands of the Japanese Imperial Army.

3
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:54,000
